eneral Statements: All Other Content","notes":"CLINICALLY RESEARCHED"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NATURAL + ARTIFICIAL FLAVORS"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"AMP"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 370077 JOG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, mix 1 scoop (8.42 g) with 4-5 fl.oz. of water or your favorite beverage, pre, during or post-workout. For maximum results, mix 2 scoops (16.84 g) with 8-10 fl.oz. of water or favorite beverage pre-workout and sip throughout your workout to power your training."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, under 18 years of age, have a medical condition, or are taking medication."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"WARNING: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, under 18 years of age, have a medical condition, or are taking medication."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NOTICE: Significant product settling may occur. \nPer 2 scoop serving."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"CarnoSyn Carnosine Synthesizer(R)"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"CarnoSyn(R) trademark and patents owned by Natural Alternatives International, Inc."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"betaPOWER(R) Natural Betaine"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BETAPOWER(TM) is a registered trademark of DuPont or its affiliates."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"INFORMED-CHOICE {Check}.ORG \nTrusted by sport"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Products bearing this logo have been tested for banned substances by HFL Sport Science, a world-class anti-doping lab. Product was tested for over 145 banned substances on the 2013 World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) Prohibited List via HFL skip lot testing protocol #ICP0307. See gnc.com for more information."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Amplified Creatine XXX(TM) Power Features 5 Products in 1! \n1. Creatine \n2. Agmatine Sulfate \n3. Beta-Alanine \n4. Choline \n5. CoQ-10"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Daily Pre/Post-Workout Stamina Power"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"The Evolution of Performance Supplementation \nGNC's most advanced creatine formula, Amplified Creatine XXX(TM), has evolved even further with the launch of Amplified Creatine XXX(TM) Power, the line's first and only creatine formulated to help give you enhanced performance and strength.* This unique formula features an unstoppable blend of 4 key forms of creatine designed to provide an instant release of creatine and using the GNC exclusive Optimal Timing Technology (OT2(M)), a form that releases over 6 hours."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Advanced Creatine Complex & Creatine Precursor Compound \nThis breakthrough formula was created with the ultimate goal of enhancing athletic performance by combining powerful doses of clinically proven ingredients to provide the strength and power benefits of an advanced creatine blend.* Loaded with 4 unique creatine sources, including OT2(TM) creatine, creatine HCL, creatine ethyl ester and creatine citrate, this powerful formula helps Increase strength and build lean muscle.* The OT2(TM) allows for a 6-hour extended release of creatine to feed your muscles before, during and after your toughest workouts to maximize your results.* To take you even further it's also packed with creatine precursors."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Power Complex \nCombines agmatine with betaine anhydrous for added power and performance plus beta alanine to help buffer muscle carnosine levels, a key marker of muscle fatigue.* Features choline and CoQ-10."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Choline is essential for making acetylcholine, a messenger chemical that is important in sending messages from one nerve cell to another. CoQ-10 is important for mitochondria function and is involved in the process that produces cellular energy and boosts ATP.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Who can benefit from taking Amplified Creatine XXX(TM) Power? \nAmplified Creatine XXX(TM) Power has re-engineered the use for creatine supplements."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"If your goal is to increase strength and power this formula is for you. You can customize your dosing and supplementation regimen to meet your specific training goals and nutrition needs."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 13728 1","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}